## Aquatic Plants & Algae — Tower Editions

All species are supplied in plug-and-play **Hydra-Pad™** or **Macro-Mesh™** inserts, compatible with AquaPod, BioFloc-Lite™, and Haloponic™ Frames for seamless integration with fish, shrimp, or bivalve modules.

